<section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-[#3353C1] text-white">
	<div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 opacity-25 [background-image:radial-gradient(#93A5DF_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:28px_28px]"></div>
	<div class="mx-auto flex min-h-[310px] max-w-7xl flex-col items-center justify-center px-4 py-16 text-center sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
		<p class="text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#DBB24D]">Услуги</p>
		<h1 class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-4xl font-black leading-tight tracking-normal text-white sm:text-5xl">
			Комплексни решения за индустриални металдетектори
		</h1>
		<p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg font-medium leading-8 text-[#F8FBFF]">
			От производство и интеграция до диагностика, калибриране и сервиз - всичко на едно място.
		</p>
		<a
			href="services#services-list"
			class="mt-8 inline-flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-white/35 bg-white/10 text-white shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-[#DBB24D] hover:bg-[#DBB24D] hover:text-[#0E1629] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-white"
			aria-label="Към секцията с услугите"
		>
			<svg class="size-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
				<path d="M12 5v14"></path>
				<path d="m19 12-7 7-7-7"></path>
			</svg>
		</a>
	</div>
</section>
